{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Blacktail and the Case of the Blood Moon is a noir detective visual novel, blending mystery, romance, and explicit H-scenes with impactful choices that shape your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951460/extras/1dc6476b525446df109cab05b3a7b104.poster.avif?t=1768565913\" width=1170 height=854 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951460/extras/1dc6476b525446df109cab05b3a7b104.webm?t=1768565913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fairgrave rots under the glow of the <strong>Blood Moon.</strong> Every four years, men vanish, and predators lose control of their hunger; crime rates sky rocket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the sharpest detective in Fairgrave, Blacktail is now a wolf without a pack; exiled, drunk, and unwanted. But when old flames spark and yet another man vanishes under the Blood Moon, he\u2019s dragged back right into the city\u2019s shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Blacktail uncover the truth, or be devoured by the hunger inside him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desire in the Shadows\ud83d\udc94</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951460/extras/b5f5594c0f7a927f3b90c0855454fe30.avif?t=1768565913\" width=1318 height=1320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951460/extras/eb8c4cee65ea2ddbe9749f1e00e91f6b.avif?t=1768565913\" width=1318 height=1212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951460/extras/62942b27ac2f8bdf04ab8dbc822e86c0.avif?t=1768565913\" width=1318 height=1320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features\ud83d\udd25</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Rich Detective Noir Story </strong>\u2013 Follow Blacktail as he uncovers the truth behind the mystery of the Blood Moon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices That Matter </strong>\u2013 Multiple endings shaped by your actions and allegiances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance &amp; Passion </strong>\u2013 Pursue explicit animated H-scenes with three very different heroines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Noir World </strong>\u2013 Gorgeous art and characters bring the city of Fairgrave to life.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951460?t=1768565913","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951460/d53ba6361f7ce831e2ed4c90209a9ea2ce551961/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768565913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951460/41b37dcc786f2f2c403e468a70f3fff406771259/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768565913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951460/41b37dcc786f2f2c403e468a70f3fff406771259/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768565913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"conten